@startuml
start
:Driver app emits GPS (lat, lon, time, tripId);
:API receives and authenticates request;
if (Auth ok?) then (yes)
  :Validate trip-driver binding;
  if (Valid?) then (yes)
    :Persist location to DB (append-only);
    :Publish gps event to Kafka;
    :Broadcast via WebSocket to subscribers;
  else (no)
    :Reject with 403 / log incident;
  endif
else (no)
  :Reject with 401;
endif

fork
  :Async consumer (Spark):
   - enrich with map-matching
   - compute speed, heading
   - detect anomalies;
  :Write curated stream to S3/DB;
fork again
  :Trigger proximity alerts for students
   near next stop;
  :Send push notifications if needed;
end fork
stop
@enduml